// Step 2: (Inv)-[:HAS_PART]->(Part)  OR  (Inv)-[:CONTAINS_SET]->(Set)  OR  (Inv)-[:CONTAINS_MINIFIG]->(Minifig)
// If Step 2 is Set or Minifig, we must follow with [:HAS_INVENTORY]->(Inv) and then repeat.

